<p>There are 253 weights from Company 11 in that range. Two weights <img src="https://latex.codecogs.com/png.latex?(7.21,%207.93)"> were removed from the dataset as they do not round to 20kg, and this doesn’t fit with Dr John’s assumption of a uniform distribution.</p>
